itdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tU3ac6egpL89ALQMu7H0QPtThuK0vL2eDmBgHa5bpzUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Rrw_le8FiCJm2G9Rc30h91FKky8_IskVt_jJ0f-v5w4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;08BVO1P6rHT2KAiemfyPkSaWYWyHLhxnTrcv2e7Ioekƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wkeWG7yLsGPUueXXrROMksdurOfTNd5fThrpQ1g2JLEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;OxGP3KewLvJLrBwxtE61JCGqSt7K9j1XLeimb9NnBOgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$62729766-0790-4b2d-b81b-004179a72bcdƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;U7GR_y34UXe1D6Dw9Glh_quU-ZQ5RctKEvfAgNe3ZXAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyİOutside the Santa Ana Public Library, a bronze sculpture stands as the most visible testament to a Palestinian-American activist whose 1985 assassination remains officially unsolved. The statue depicts Alex Odeh holding a dove and was created in 1994 by Algerian-American artist Khalil Bendib. It has endured decades of targeting â€” paint splashed on it in 1996 and again in 1997, and the bronze dove was stolen, later recovered, and reattached in 2020, according to [Hyperallergic](https://hyperallergic.com/a-living-memorial-to-palestinian-activist-alex-odeh-takes-flight/). Most recently the sculpture was vandalized again, with brick remnants left scattered around it.

Now that battered monument anchors a new participatory project intended to keep Odeh's memory in motion rather than confined to a single damaged site. Artist Jon Rubin first encountered the statue in 2023, while on residency at the Grand Central Art Center in Santa Ana, according to Hyperallergic. Rubin told the publication that a combination of factors drew him toward the work. Rather than restore a fixed public object, the project is conceived as decentralized: a form of shared hospitality and conversation organized around Odeh's legacy, with people gathering rather than simply passing by. The bronze dove, removed last December, will travel over several months to host events, dinners, and performances organized by various individuals and organizations, [Hyperallergic reports](https://hyperallergic.com/a-living-memorial-to-palestinian-activist-alex-odeh-takes-flight/).

Odeh's life traced the defining displacements of twentieth-century Palestinian history. He was born in 1944 into a Catholic family in Jifna, Palestine, and as a child experienced the Nakba; as a young man he witnessed the Israeli military occupation of the West Bank that followed the 1967 war, according to the same source. After immigrating to the United States, he pursued graduate study in political science, completing a Master's degree at California State University, Fullerton, in 1972, and went on to teach Arabic and Middle East history, Hyperallergic reports. Through the early 1980s he served as the West Coast regional director of the American-Arab Anti-Discrimination Committee (ADC), where his work centered on challenging hate crimes and anti-Arab bias in public life.

Odeh's advocacy was explicitly oriented toward coexistence â€” he was committed to dialogue among Christians, Muslims, and Jews â€” and he had been scheduled to speak at a local synagogue for Friday prayer services, according to Hyperallergic. On October 11, 1985, a pipe bomb detonated at the ADC's Santa Ana offices, killing him. Investigative journalists and the FBI have identified members of the Jewish Defense League as possibly responsible for the attack, but no one has ever been arrested, and the murder officially remains unsolved, according to Hyperallergic.

Rubin told Hyperallergic that many people he encountered near the Santa Ana statue were simply unfamiliar with Odeh's life â€” a life spent trying to reduce, not inflame, communal animosity. A documentary titled *Stolen Dove*, focused on Odeh's killing, had its premiere at the Sundance Film Festival in January, according to the same source.

The project's structure reflects the condition it addresses: a legacy of coexistence housed in a repeatedly targeted monument. Rather than anchor memory to one place, the traveling dove is meant to generate ongoing public gathering and conversation about who Odeh was and what he stood for.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;yzTeTG0bfA3Ic2P34U8tvE7hzEINEz0-XKV8mdgKcGsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;RQIu1998yrF7U-sqD8QggWY948tz8j8QKrX4fFzZl70ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fqBIDN0lPMMYcZN-c427tyUjVeqAVk4FopEEdvcJ57sƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gCp0CilJ0oPKd18suX1zlXzSSRWufrUCOzCG2LciFtgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxclaude-code-cli-invocationsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wWSqUJJGPgLP14dD5WiRQQHslRPrvi4LcXPFNX3zUhYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;o4eeJr22vX5Rt_0ulkLpHAyBT9d7pPKlBW1V2S1LcgEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkf95.596ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fAem3NgwivZhf-JZn9D1eB_hM0OfUBxV6krveYb-awAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;92AVkl-7xPkW9yV1XB6JzfKWZ_cZIHQMa-I_2ipBtA8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;wsOAJU3F0iE0NgK8CHrMDDG-Qz8yzMQR8qX7W0BxcyIƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Zs26plt8PQUZUPzV5aLomPu30xwlbF4KeIZC08cVvBAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxe